                        "body": "Two options for the board's **lane order**: keep `sortLanes()` or read it from [the docs](https://docs.example/board).\n\n```typescript\nconst lanes = sortLanes(board);\n```\n\n| Option | Cost |\n| ------ | ---- |\n| keep | none |\n| read | one call |\n\n@ben, what do you think?",
                        "bodyHtml": "<p data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:118\" dir=\"auto\">Two options for the board's <strong data-sourcepos=\"1:29-1:42\">lane order</strong>: keep <code data-sourcepos=\"1:50-1:62\">sortLanes()</code> or read it from <a data-sourcepos=\"1:80-1:117\" href=\"https://docs.example/board\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">the docs</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"gl-relative markdown-code-block js-markdown-code\"><pre data-sourcepos=\"3:1-5:3\" lang=\"typescript\" class=\"code highlight js-syntax-highlight language-typescript\" v-pre=\"true\"><code><span id=\"LC1\" class=\"line\" lang=\"typescript\"><span class=\"kd\">const</span> <span class=\"nx\">lanes</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nf\">sortLanes</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">board</span><span class=\"p\">);</span></span></code></pre><copy-code></copy-code><insert-code-snippet></insert-code-snippet></div>\n<table data-sourcepos=\"7:1-10:20\" dir=\"auto\">\n<thead>\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:17\">\n<th data-sourcepos=\"7:2-7:9\">Option</th>\n<th data-sourcepos=\"7:11-7:16\">Cost</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:17\">\n<td data-sourcepos=\"9:2-9:7\">keep</td>\n<td data-sourcepos=\"9:9-9:16\">none</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:20\">\n<td data-sourcepos=\"10:2-10:7\">read</td>\n<td data-sourcepos=\"10:9-10:19\">one call</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"12:1-12:24\" dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"/ben\" data-reference-type=\"user\" data-user=\"3\" data-original=\"@ben\" title=\"Ben Okafor\" class=\"gfm gfm-project_member js-user-link\">@ben</a>, what do you think?</p>",
